-# that executed -- B1 (exp5015) -- proved the opportunity is REAL and LARGE: genuine tuned-SC 0.585, oracle@K
-# 0.865 = +0.28 selectable headroom on MuSR (headroom_present=True, oracle-distinct). The cheap prompted proxy
