-  B2''s 0-rows generator via incremental re-scoring of the 200 existing cached candidates), and makes three
-  structural de-risking moves: (1) DECOUPLE the headline D1 from the fragile B2 cache -- D1 trains a LoRA-EBM on
-  candidate TEXT + gold (already in the cached MuSR checkpoints) and evals by re-scoring, so it needs no logprobs
