-  python/carnot/moat_trainer.py = a prioritized real-base resolver + a cap-surviving QLoRA energy-head trainer + a
-  60s smoke that proves the pipeline before D1''s full run); (3) route the twice-failed load-bearing arms (B3, D1)
-  OFF codex to claude/opus per the .462 capstone pointer. The opportunity is proven real by .462 B1: +0.28
-  selectable headroom on MuSR (oracle@K 0.865 vs genuine SC 0.585), oracle-distinct, headroom_present -- the open
-  question is whether a TRAINED verifier captures it where the cheap prompted proxy did not. D2 replicates uPRM
-  (arXiv:2605.10158) over the fixed B2 cache WITH a self-supervised frozen-candidate PRM fallback (2507.01951/
-  2502.14356) so it is not single-point-blocked; D3 rebuilds EBRM (arXiv:2504.13134) refining the REAL D1 scorer
-  with uncertainty + CoT-Entropy (2502.11250) + conformal abstention (CROP 2605.30085), capped <=50%; D6 is the
-  efficiency cascade (arXiv:2510.20369) with VERDI confidence routing (2605.11334); D4 generalizes the best arm to
