-  skeleton/blocked/degenerate arm is a FAILED execution, NOT a null; retire_if_same_verdict only on a properly-
-  executed D1+uPRM clean-null. Anti-traps: GENUINE tuned-SC (B1), oracle@K + headroom_present per arm, n>=200,
-  paired bootstrap + McNemar, oracle-distinctness lint, a train_loss-non-null gate, a real-base resolver. Reserved:
-  2 infra (B2, B3), 1 hardware (C), 1 SOTA-ingestion (E1), continuous self-learning (E2) + 1 opportunistic ARC
-  (E3). GPU-0 CUDA (2026-06-27), NOT iGPU-pinned. Do NOT re-propose any nulled/retired/concluded lever (energy-as-
