-    logprob candidate cache by RE-SCORING the 200 EXISTING cached MuSR candidates (NOT regenerating from scratch) --
-    one forward pass per candidate string through the GPU-0 llama-server with logprobs, INCREMENTAL per-row append
-    (write each row immediately), per-question try/except continue, resumable. This UNBLOCKS D2 (uPRM); the headline
-    D1 no longer depends on it.'
-  priority: high
-  track: infra
-  max_turns: 60
