-      by skipping done rows and NEVER loses prior rows; (c) the gate requires n_cached_rows>0 (a 0-row run is a FAILED
-      execution, recorded honestly, not a silent pass). Different source (re-score not regenerate), write discipline
-      (incremental not batch), and gate."
